    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "novel_id": "vizhigalil-vizhundha-kavithai",
      "chapter_num": 1,
      "title": "Chapter 01 — Silence of the Eyes",
      "title_ta": "Chapter 01 — Silence of the Eyes",
      "content": "Words are easy to utter, but silence holds the truest poetry of love. In the university library between rows of classical literature, their silent companionship had quietly grown over three years.\n\nA single exchange of glances conveyed what entire volumes could not express.",
