    {
      "id": 10,
      "novel_id": "poongaatru-punnagaikka",
      "chapter_num": 1,
      "title": "Story 01 — Rainy Drizzle People",
      "title_ta": "Story 01 — Rainy Drizzle People",
      "content": "Underneath the green tin awning of the roadside tea stall, seven strangers huddled together to escape a sudden torrential downpour.\n\nAs hot ginger tea was passed around in glass tumblers, stories began to flow. In those forty-five minutes of shared warmth, seven lives touched and enriched one another before the rain stopped and they went their separate ways.",
